{"dog":{"age_group":"young","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Medium mixed breed","breed_primary":"Medium Mixed Breed Cross","description_text":"This pet needs emergency placement. Please click here to go to our emergency placement page for more information.\n\nMillie is at risk due to behavioral reasons. While in care, Millie has been observed to be highly fearful. Noted to have a tense body, tucked tail, and maintains her distance from handlers. While on leash, Millie will balk, flail, and pull towards familiar places. Often times Millie has to be picked up and carried by handlers. Her previous owner describes her as a social and affectionate dog. With familiar handlers Millie will engage with toys, sits on your lap, enjoys being dressed up, and allows all handling. Medically, Millie is currently in heat, has shown signs of psychogenic polydipsia which we believe is due to her anxious behavior, and is otherwise is healthy at this time.","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=3%2C16&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=16&searchType=4&animalid=209752","id":"0754c77e7f2490f792063b0946781443","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/d46f6094c55647309988c4952f2f6b42-1794147650-1794147654-png/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/514b02351e58468880e8f517f06005e5-1793021947-1794105775-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/287fbf7a1f5246a68e21c96d41549e32-1793021947-1793889532-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/dbd30ba1062f452a96d91eb83741fb95-1793546088-1793643782-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/73f6048415914b9d96d2b448cefd4b2b-1793120887-1793120887-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/0f32736abd3940aeb209483f5d6c073d-1793120884-1793120884-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/s